#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:225 74b42515824544208220b0ed90ef63ce
msgid ""
"Uses a flat custom rolloff curve with unity gain at every distance. Preserves 3D panning, Doppler"
" and emission-cone settings. :ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` "
"and :ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` do not affect "
"distance gain in this mode."
msgstr ""
"使用平坦的自定义衰减曲线，使所有距离处的增益均为 1。保留 3D 声像、多普勒和发声锥设置。此模式下，\\  "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`  和  "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>`  不影响距离增益。"

