msgid ""
"Preloads the assigned stream by creating its internal :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`. Returns "
"``false`` if no stream is assigned or sound creation fails."
msgstr "通过创建内部  :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`  预加载音频流。未设置音频流或声音创建失败时返回  ``false`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:683 adf06a3b07bd4143854b030b90bdbcb0
