msgstr "可用选项见  :ref:`AttenuationModel<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_AttenuationModel>` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:697 aeae86eb39f24626ad723c32c331882b
msgid "Returns the current attenuation model."
msgstr "返回当前距离衰减模型"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:699 a09c580c6e04418fa01a641b559b0ea4
