msgstr "可用值见    :ref:`AttenuationModel<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_AttenuationModel>`   。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:711 24a5aadb12bf4bd89122ff78ea8ef18d
msgid "Sets the volume in decibels."
msgstr "设置基础音量，单位为分贝"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:713 b9ce6ba0ec3d4f7fa2e1517056d7f92e
msgid "\\ ``0.0`` is unity gain. Negative values attenuate, positive values amplify (if supported)."
msgstr "``0.0``    为单位增益；负值衰减，正值放大（若支持）。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:725 6721a5ec52f440e88922e99a23749c98
msgid "Returns the current volume in decibels."
msgstr "返回基础音量，单位为分贝"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:727 eb530d87d8fa49a0bbbd05895ed3d9e4
msgid "The default value is ``0.0`` dB (unity gain)."
msgstr "默认值为    ``0.0``    dB，即单位增益。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:739 c9e02dc3cda54421a7a72244a819da28
msgid ""
"Sets the minimum rolloff distance in scene units, clamped to at least ``0.001``. Also scales "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` when configuring FMOD."
msgstr ""
"设置以场景单位表示的最小衰减距离，最小为  ``0.001`` \\ 。配置 FMOD 时也用于缩放  "
":ref:`max_distance<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_max_distance>` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:751 03ad8dcdf719499a8192d3a55d6cff9c
msgid "Returns the minimum rolloff distance in scene units."
msgstr "返回以场景单位表示的最小衰减距离。"

