msgid "\\ ``1.0`` is normal pitch. Higher values increase pitch and playback speed."
msgstr "``1.0``    为正常音高。较大的值会提高音高和播放速度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:777 e9b5819fb5224b1a909bcb72fb92597a
