msgid "Returns ``true`` while a playback channel is active, including while paused."
msgstr "播放通道处于活动状态时返回  ``true`` \\ ，暂停时也返回  ``true`` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:817 24c5147817644b84aadce31c9cbc707b
msgid ""
"Sets :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>`. Automatic playback is "
"deferred until the node is ready and is disabled in the editor."
msgstr ""
"设置  :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>` \\ "
"。自动播放会延迟到节点就绪后执行，在编辑器中不生效。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:829 56d6fcc6976b4acaa998a3a673ed0b5b
msgid "Returns whether :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>` is enabled."
msgstr "返回是否启用了  :ref:`auto_play<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_auto_play>` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:841 4d786e2b1f3f43718a84de10b3bcd163
msgid ""
"If enabled, assigning :ref:`stream<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_stream>` immediately "
"preloads it."
msgstr "设置是否在赋值    :ref:`stream<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_stream>`    时立即预加载。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:853 ef44219d660e4792a70be56c24ff401b
msgid "Returns ``true`` if streams are preloaded as soon as they are assigned."
msgstr "如果启用了赋值时预加载，则返回    ``true``   。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:865 e48fb10d1cca4bbabbd74631b60f514c
msgid "Pauses or resumes playback without changing position."
msgstr "暂停或恢复当前播放流"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:877 45cba958af5f4c20ab511c13775fcaa2
msgid "Returns ``true`` if the stream playback is currently paused."
msgstr "返回当前播放流的暂停状态"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:889 0fb210e11f7f4520bffc73c1ec084b3d
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum rolloff distance multiplier, clamped to at least ``0.01``. FMOD receives "
"``distance`` multiplied by :ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`. "
"The attenuation model determines behavior beyond that distance."
msgstr ""
"设置最大衰减距离倍率，最小为  ``0.01`` \\ 。传递给 FMOD 的距离为  ``distance``  乘以  "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` \\ 。超出此距离后的行为由衰减模型决定。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:903 15754fdf79624f9087bc193dde4d6a1b
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum rolloff distance multiplier. Multiply it by "
":ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>` to obtain the distance passed "
"to FMOD."
msgstr ""
"返回最大衰减距离倍率。将其乘以  :ref:`unit_size<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_unit_size>`  可得到传递给 FMOD "
"的距离。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:917 54b27a696c414402bee68d58491b3f0a
msgid ""
"Selects the bus used when the next playback channel is created. Changing this value does not "
"reroute an existing channel."
msgstr "设置下次创建播放通道时使用的总线。修改此值不会改变现有通道的路由。"

