msgid ""
"If the bus is not found in :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`, playback uses the"
" master channel group."
msgstr "在  :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`  中找不到该总线时，播放使用主通道组。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:931 19e3824915724919bcb7b97c38c375e3
msgid "Returns the name of the audio bus this player outputs to."
msgstr "返回当前输出总线名称"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:933 793c15e00d634d0d9f82e1a5226b2d9e
msgid "The default value is ``&\"Master\"``."
msgstr "默认值为  ``&\"Master\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:945 20656f317ffb4398aef61fd742e65bf8
msgid "Stores ``mask``. Area-based audio filtering is not implemented by this player."
msgstr "保存  ``mask`` \\ 。此播放器尚未实现基于区域的音频过滤。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:957 58fc7e907cbf40f18c463e24231f55bc
msgid "Returns the stored area mask. It currently has no effect on playback."
msgstr "返回保存的区域掩码，此值目前不影响播放。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:969 350f38dd6ee7413da5348e6960f719db
msgid "Enables or disables the directional emission cone."
msgstr "启用或禁用方向性发射锥"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:971 757ef145aded4190b81816625c0d0875
msgid "When enabled, sound is projected in a cone rather than omnidirectionally."
msgstr "启用后，声音通过锥形区域向外传播。"

