msgid "Returns ``true`` if the emission angle cone is enabled."
msgstr "如果启用了方向性发射锥，则返回    ``true``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:985 fc0e567b36da4852b90e3f8f589e7462
msgid "When enabled, sound is directional within the configured cone."
msgstr "启用后，声音仅在配置的发声锥内具有完整指向性。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:997 684edf3ad98d4e9b851abb451a52fdf9
msgid ""
"Sets the inner emission angle in degrees, clamped to ``0.0`` through ``90.0``. The inspector and "
"saved scenes use degrees without conversion."
msgstr "设置发声内锥角，单位为度，限制在  ``0.0``  到  ``90.0``  之间。检查器和保存的场景直接使用度数，无需转换。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:999 b07617c110a340f8abdf743ab6495c8d
msgid "Sound is at full volume within this cone and attenuated outside."
msgstr "声音在该发声锥内保持完整音量，在锥外衰减。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1011 4dc1614e1ad84034b0487c7fb17ac81c
msgid "Returns the inner emission angle in degrees."
msgstr "返回发射内锥角，单位为度"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1013 63d16d788dd446d4b7f3e7c430cd9e2c
msgid "Sound is at full volume within this cone."
msgstr "发声锥内的声音保持完整音量。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1015 e5125d8117764699a431beeac546e591
msgid "The default value is ``45.0`` degrees."
msgstr "默认值为    ``45.0``    度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1027 5a688cf6fd68450bbadfa29dfb6b71d0
msgid "Sets the attenuation outside the emission cone in dB, clamped to ``-80.0`` through ``0.0``."
msgstr "设置发声锥外的衰减量，单位为 dB，限制在  ``-80.0``  到  ``0.0``  之间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1029 5f8135eced0649ad8899406649ac1771
msgid "More negative values create a sharper directional effect."
msgstr "值越负，方向性效果越明显。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1041 f728ae523d10476193be35c4b57ab663
msgid "Returns the attenuation outside the emission cone in dB."
msgstr "返回发射锥外的音量衰减，单位为分贝"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1043 25718fe91c584db1abffe846da93ca03
msgid "The default value is ``-12.0`` dB."
msgstr "默认值为    ``-12.0``    dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1079 69ffc3c09b994f5fb1bbde50f310f9bb
msgid ""
"Sets :ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>`. "
"Updates the native filter immediately during playback."
msgstr ""
"设置  :ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>` \\"
" 。播放期间会立即更新原生滤波器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1091 4e739b21dd0b47b69b654152f605c3be
msgid ""
"Returns "
":ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>` in dB."
msgstr ""
"返回  :ref:`attenuation_filter_db<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_property_attenuation_filter_db>` \\"
" ，单位为 dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1103 db16cf8a62c24b91854c03ab46dd7dc5
msgid "Sets the doppler tracking mode for velocity-based pitch changes."
msgstr "设置多普勒速度追踪模式"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1105 ff49ffbd6a1d46048c1a88d6256f196d
msgid "See :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>` for available options."
msgstr "可用选项见  :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1117 fb87e3db83e14c7189bd0d7f8a446bc4
msgid "Returns the current doppler tracking mode."
msgstr "返回当前多普勒速度追踪模式"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer3d.rst:1119 1b462efb5a7e42f4b9ade4c1235aafdb
msgid "See :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>` for possible values."
msgstr "可用值见    :ref:`DopplerTracking<enum_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D_DopplerTracking>`   。"
